# Sample targets file for portscanner --hosts-file / the action's hosts-file input.
# One entry per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
# Supported forms (each expands under the --max-hosts cap):
#   - a single IP or domain:      10.0.0.5
#   - a CIDR block:                10.0.1.0/24
#   - an inclusive IP range:       10.0.2.10-10.0.2.250
#
# For tens of thousands of targets, prefer several precise CIDR blocks
# over one huge one — it keeps the file readable and makes it easy to
# comment out a subnet temporarily without touching the rest.

10.10.0.0/22
10.10.4.0/23
10.20.0.0/24
hss01.core.example.net
pgw-gi.core.example.net
10.30.10.1-10.30.10.60
